* #icdas-caries-assessment "ICDAS caries assessment" "Visual caries assessment using an ICDAS lesion score."
* #pulp-sensibility-assessment "Pulp sensibility assessment" "Assessment of the sensory response of the dental pulp."
* #prosthetic-device-finding "Prosthetic device finding" "Technical finding concerning a removable prosthesis or implant suprastructure."
* #osas-oral-appliance-eligibility "OSAS oral appliance eligibility" "Dental eligibility assessment for an oral appliance used in an OSAS care pathway."
* #osas-oral-appliance-complication "OSAS oral appliance complication" "Complication observed during oral appliance therapy."
